# Magic Lantern lens_tune.tbl — Canon lens picture-style trims + CA profiles
# Format: lens_id|contrast|saturation|color_tone|ev_bias|wb_r|wb_b|ca_strength|fringe_reduce
# ca_strength: [0..100] chromatic aberration correction strength
# fringe_reduce: [0..100] purple/green fringe suppression strength
# Backward compatible: 7-column rows still valid (ca defaults to 0)
#
# contrast/saturation/color_tone: [-4..+4] picture style bias
# ev_bias: 1/8 EV steps, [-3..+1]
# wb_r/wb_b: white balance scale (1024 = 1.0x)
#
# Lens ID 0 = neutral (fallback for unknown lenses)
# 7-column rows (without ca_strength/fringe_reduce) are valid legacy format.
#
#user — tuning verified on Canon EOS 6D (DIGIC 5+)
0|0|0|0|0|1024|1024|0|0
